sult_summary": "{\"paths\": []}", "latency_ms": 4, "tokens_before": 23095, "tokens_after": 23095, "ok": true, "error": ""}], "final_claim": {"task_id": "t_f2efc73e", "decision": "absent", "mechanism": "cascade", "entities": [1885, 1460], "window": [18083, 27683], "confidence": 0.92, "evidence": [{"trace_id": "step_01", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_10", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_03", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_04", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_05", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_07", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_08", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_09", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_02", "role": "confounder_control"}], "narrative": "No time-respecting chain runs from 1885 to 1460 in [18083,27683] under the 600-unit relay limit, and none exists even with the limit removed or the window widened to the full timeline. 1885 has a single interaction in the window; the two neighborhoods meet only through undirected, non-ordered static links (1453/1871). Static connectivity and the nodes' overall activity are therefore confounders, not evidence of a cascade."}, "raw_final_response": "**Conclusion: no cascade.**\n\n- **step_01**: With the 600-unit relay constraint, 1885 reaches only 2 nodes in the window and never 1460.\n- **step_04**: Even with *no* waiting-time limit, 1885 cannot temporally reach 1460 in the window \u2014 so the failure is not an artifact of the 600-unit threshold.\n- **step_10**: Zero time-respecting paths enumerated.\n- **step_03 / step_02**: 1885 has a single event (one partner) in this window, in a sparse, near-non-repeating graph (2186 events, repeat ratio 0.004) \u2014 no substrate for a relay chain.\n- **step_05 / step_07**: Ignoring time, the two 3-hop neighborhoods only touch via 1453/1871, i.e. a static link exists at long range but carries no ordered chain.\n- **step_08 / step_09**: Lifetime activity (1885: 18 events; hub 1566: 468 events) shows the nodes are not inactive overall, and reachability still fails over the whole timeline \u2014 popularity and volume do not rescue the cascade claim.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"t_f2efc73e\",\n  \"decision\": \"absent\",\n  \"mechanism\": \"cascade\",\n  \"entities\": [1885, 1460],\n  \"window\": [18083, 27683],\n  \"confidence\": 0.92,\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_01\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_10\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_03\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_04\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_05\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_07\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_08\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_09\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_02\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"}\n  ],\n  \"narrative\": \"No time-respecting chain runs from 1885 to 1460 in [18083,27683] under the 600-unit relay limit, and none exists even with the limit removed or the window widened to the full timeline. 1885 has a single interaction in the window; the two neighborhoods meet only through undirected, non-ordered static links (1453/1871). Static connectivity and the nodes' overall activity are therefore confounders, not evidence of a cascade.\"\n}\n```", "total_input_tokens": 31214, "total_output_tokens": 2617, "total_tokens": 33831, "total_latency_ms": 42793, "llm_calls": 5, "schema_repairs": 0, "tool_protocol_errors": 0, "status": "success", "error": ""}